  m_text: '<b>HOW TO PLAY</b>


    Make the best five-card poker hand using your
    two private cards and the five shared community cards.


    Fold: Give up the
    current hand.

    Check: Pass your turn without betting, when allowed.

    Call:
    Match the current bet.

    Raise: Increase the current bet.

    All-in: Bet
    all your remaining chips.

    Half Pot / Full Pot: Quickly select a raise amount.


    You
    have 30 seconds to act on your turn. If time expires, you will automatically
    Check or Fold.


    This game uses virtual chips only.'
